.TH OTPME-POOL 1 "2025-12-29" "OTPme 0.3.0a120" "OTPme Manual"
.SH NAME
otpme-pool \- manage OTPme node pools
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B otpme-pool
.I command
[\fIoptions\fR] [\fIpool\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B otpme-pool
manages node pools in the OTPme system. A pool defines which nodes are used for a share.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS Pool Management
.TP
.B add \fIpool\fR
Create a new pool.
.TP
.B del \fIpool\fR
Delete a pool. Asks for confirmation according to the confirmation policy, and warns about shares that use the pool.
.TP
.B show \fR[\fIpool\fR]
Display pool information.
.TP
.B list \fR[\fIregex\fR]
List pools, optionally filtered by regex pattern.
.TP
.B enable \fIpool\fR
Enable a disabled pool.
.TP
.B disable \fIpool\fR
Disable a pool without deleting it.
.TP
.B rename \fIpool\fR \fInew_name\fR
Rename a pool.
.TP
.B move \fR[\fB\-\-keep\-acls\fR] \fIpool\fR \fIunit\fR
Move pool to a different unit.
.TP
.B touch \fIpool\fR
Re-index the object to fix potential index problems.
.SS Node Management
.TP
.B add_node \fIpool\fR \fInode\fR
Add a node to the pool.
.TP
.B remove_node \fIpool\fR \fInode\fR
Remove a node from the pool.
.TP
.B list_nodes \fR[\fB\-\-return\-type\fR \fITYPE\fR] \fIpool\fR
List nodes in the pool. Use \fB\-\-return\-type\fR to select the attribute returned (\fBname\fR, \fBread_oid\fR, \fBfull_oid\fR, \fBuuid\fR).
.SS Policy Management
.TP
.B add_policy \fIpool\fR \fIpolicy\fR
Attach a policy to the pool.
.TP
.B remove_policy \fIpool\fR \fIpolicy\fR
Remove a policy from the pool.
.TP
.B list_policies \fR[\fB\-\-return\-type\fR \fITYPE\fR] [\fB\-\-policy\-types\fR \fIt1,t2\fR] \fIpool\fR
List policies attached to the pool. Use \fB\-\-return\-type\fR to select the attribute returned (\fBname\fR, \fBread_oid\fR, \fBfull_oid\fR, \fBuuid\fR).
.SS ACL Management
.TP
.B add_acl \fIpool\fR \fIowner_type\fR \fIowner\fR \fIacl\fR
Add an access control entry.
.TP
.B del_acl \fIpool\fR \fIacl\fR
Remove an access control entry.
.TP
.B show_acls \fIpool\fR
Display all ACLs for the pool.
.TP
.B enable_acl_inheritance \fIpool\fR
Enable ACL inheritance from parent objects.
.TP
.B disable_acl_inheritance \fIpool\fR
Disable ACL inheritance.
.SS Configuration
.TP
.B description \fIpool\fR \fR[\fIdescription\fR]
Set pool description.
.TP
.B info \fR[\fB\-\-language\fR \fILANG\fR] \fIpool\fR \fR[\fIinfo\fR]
Set free-form info text. If \fIinfo\fR is omitted, the current info text is
opened in the editor specified by the \fBEDITOR\fR environment variable.
.TP
.B dump_info \fR[\fB\-\-language\fR \fILANG\fR] \fIpool\fR
Dump the info text to stdout.
.SS Object Changelog
.TP
.B changelog \fIpool\fR
Show the object's changelog (chronological list of changes with author, timestamp and optional custom text passed via \fB\-\-changelog\fR).
.TP
.B edit_changelog \fIpool\fR \fIchangelog_id\fR
Open the given changelog entry in the editor named by \fBEDITOR\fR to edit its custom text.
.TP
.B del_changelog \fIpool\fR \fIchangelog_id\fR
Remove a single entry from the object's changelog.
.TP
.B clear_changelog \fIpool\fR
Clear the object's entire changelog.
.SS Import/Export
.TP
.B export \fR[\fB\-\-password\fR \fIPASS\fR] \fIpool\fR
Export pool configuration.
.TP
.B remove_orphans \fIpool\fR
Remove orphaned object references.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Display Options
.TP
.B \-a
Show all pools.
.TP
.B \-z \fISIZE\fR
Limit output size.
.TP
.B \-\-fields \fIFIELD1,FIELD2\fR
Display only specified fields.
.TP
.B \-\-node\-limit \fIN\fR
Limit number of nodes shown.
.TP
.B \-\-token\-limit \fIN\fR
Limit number of member tokens shown.
.TP
.B \-\-role\-limit \fIN\fR
Limit number of member roles shown.
.TP
.B \-\-policy\-limit \fIN\fR
Limit number of policies shown.
.TP
.B \-\-limit \fIN\fR
Limit number of items shown per object.
.TP
.B \-\-sort\-by \fIFIELD\fR
Sort output by field.
.TP
.B \-\-reverse
Reverse sort order.
.TP
.B \-\-raw
Output without headers/borders.
.TP
.B \-\-csv
Output as CSV.
.TP
.B \-\-csv\-sep \fISEP\fR
CSV separator character.
.SS General Options
.TP
.B \-\-keep\-acls
Preserve ACLs when moving pool.
.TP
.B \-\-password \fIPASS\fR
Password for encrypting exports.
.PP
Global options are available for all commands. See
.BR otpme (1)
for details.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B otpme-pool add europe
Create a pool
.TP
.B otpme-pool add_node europe node-eu-1
Add a node to the pool
.TP
.B otpme-pool list_nodes europe
List nodes in the pool
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /var/lib/otpme/
OTPme data directory
